<section class=\"left-section what\">\n        <div class=\"orange-circle placeholder\">\n          <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: horizontal distancing arrows]</span>\n          <span class=\"distance-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↔</span>\n        </div>\n        <h2 class=\"section-heading\">WHAT IS SOCIAL<br>DISTANCING?</h2>\n        <p class=\"body-copy\">\n          Social distancing, also called physical distancing, is a<br>\n          form of <strong>non-pharmaceutical intervention</strong>, which<br>\n          downtrends the spread of contagious diseases simply<br>\n          by <strong>keeping people “apart” from each other.</strong>\n        </p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"left-section why\">\n        <div class=\"orange-circle placeholder\">\n          <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: alert symbol]</span>\n          <span class=\"alert-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <h2 class=\"section-heading\">WHY IS SOCIAL<br>DISTANCING IMPORTANT?</h2>\n        <p class=\"body-copy\">\n          It <strong>prevents contact between infected and uninfected<br>\n          individuals</strong>, resulting in reduced disease transmission<br>\n          and less deaths from fatal diseases.\n        </p>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-column\">\n      <div class=\"right-top\">\n        <div class=\"orange-circle check-circle placeholder\">\n          <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: check mark]</span>\n          <span class=\"checkmark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <h2 class=\"right-title\">BEST PRACTICES FOR<br>SOCIAL DISTANCING</h2>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"practice-list\">\n        <section class=\"practice home\">\n          <div class=\"practice-icon placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: home]</span>\n            <div class=\"line-icon home-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <span class=\"roof\"></span>\n              <span class=\"door\"></span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"practice-text\">\n            <strong>Self/Home Quarantine: Stay home.</strong> Only go out<br>\n            if it’s very essential, that too with protection<br>\n            (gloves, masks, sanitizers)\n          </p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"practice gatherings\">\n          <div class=\"practice-icon placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: public gathering]</span>\n            <div class=\"line-icon people-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <span class=\"person\"></span>\n              <span class=\"person\"></span>\n              <span class=\"person\"></span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"practice-text\">\n            <strong>Avoid public gatherings</strong> as much as possible\n          </p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"practice shops\">\n          <div class=\"practice-icon placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: storefront]</span>\n            <div class=\"shop-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <span class=\"awning\"></span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"practice-text\">\n            Keep spots susceptible to mass gatherings<br>\n            like <strong>parks, malls, food courts, restaurants<br>\n            and schools closed.</strong> Restaurants can be<br>\n            instructed to follow a “Takeaway” only<br>\n            system until the situation relaxes\n          </p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"practice distance\">\n          <div class=\"practice-icon placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: measuring tape]</span>\n            <div class=\"tape-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"practice-text\">\n            Maintain a distance of <strong>at least 1 - 2 meters<br>\n            (3 to 6 feet) from other individuals</strong>\n          </p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"practice hands\">\n          <div class=\"practice-icon placeholder\">\n            <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: handshake]</span>\n            <span class=\"handshake-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🤝</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"practice-text\">\n            <strong>Avoid shaking hands</strong> and embracing one another\n          </p>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"curve-section\">\n    <div class=\"orange-circle curve-icon-circle placeholder\">\n      <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: rising line chart]</span>\n      <span class=\"chart-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"curve-title\">\n      SOCIAL DISTANCING IN THE TIME<br>\n      OF COVID-19: FLATTENING THE CURVE\n    </h2>\n\n    <p class=\"curve-copy\">\n      For a disease like COVID-19, which spreads through air droplets from sneezing and coughing, scientists have claimed<br>\n      that <strong>social distancing might “flatten the curve”.</strong>\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"curve-copy\">\n      This means that if proper social distancing protocols are followed, the spread of the disease will <strong>slow down and<br>\n      relieve health care professionals and medical centers</strong> of the burden of providing aid to hundreds of patients at a<br>\n      time, which is not feasible.\n    </p>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"sources\">\n      <div class=\"source-label\">SOURCE:</div>\n      <div class=\"source-line\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Social_distancing</div>\n      <div class=\"source-line\">https://www.who.int/emergencies/diseases/novel-coronavirus-2019/advice-for-public</div>\n      <div class=\"source-line\">https://www.vox.com/2020/3/15/21179296/coronavirus-covid-19-social-distancing-bored-pandemic-quarantine-ethics</